  {
   "id": 666431,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Given <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">hour = 12</code>, what is printed?\n<pre class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">if hour &lt; 8:\n&nbsp;&nbsp;print(\"Too early\")\nelif hour &lt; 12:\n&nbsp;&nbsp;print(\"Good morning\")\nelif hour &lt; 13:\n&nbsp;&nbsp;print(\"Lunchtime\")\nelif hour &lt; 17:\n&nbsp;&nbsp;print(\"Good afternoon\")\nelse:\n&nbsp;&nbsp;print(\"Too late\")\n</pre>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1328345,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">Good morning</code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "12 &lt; 8 is False and 12 &lt; 12 is False. 12 &lt; 13 is True, so what is printed?"
    },
    {
     "id": 1328346,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">Lunchtime</code>",
     "correctness": "1.0",
     "feedback_html": "The third branch executes if <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">hour &lt; 8 and hour &lt; 12</code> is <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">False</code> and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">hour &lt; 13</code> is <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">True</code>."
    },
    {
     "id": 1328347,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">Good afternoon</code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "Another condition is true and executes before elif hour &lt; 17. 12 &lt; 8 is False, 12 &lt; 12 is False, and 12 &lt; 13 is ...?"
    },
    {
     "id": 1328348,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">Too late</code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "Another condition is true and executes before the else. 12 &lt; 8 is False, 12 &lt; 12 is False, and 12 &lt; 13 is ...?"
    }
